  "prefLabel": "Hedc 102.04 Office Location and Mailing Address, Telephone Number, and Website",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Hedc 102.04 Office Location and Mailing Address, Telephone Number, and Website.\n\n(a) The commission’s office location and mailing address is:\n\nHigher Education Commission\n\nNew Hampshire Department of Education\n\n25 Hall Street\n\nConcord, New Hampshire 03301\n\n(b) The commission’s telephone number is (603) 271-0257.\n\n(c) The commission’s website is https://www.education.nh.gov/who-we-are/higher-education-commission.\n\nSource. #14402, eff 10-15-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/hedc100.html"
